Akriven source license boundary

This repository contains both open-source software and proprietary managed
product software. A package's npm "private" flag is not a copyright license;
the controlling boundary is the path-based license map in
product-boundary.json.

Open-source paths listed in product-boundary.json are licensed under the MIT
License in LICENSES/MIT.txt. Package-local copies of that license may also be
included in distributable packages.

All other first-party paths in this repository, unless a file says otherwise,
are proprietary and governed by LICENSES/AKRIVEN-PROPRIETARY.txt.

Third-party dependencies, benchmark data, and separately attributed assets
retain their own licenses. Nothing in this notice changes those licenses.

This boundary applies to this revision and later revisions that carry it.
Rights already granted with an earlier revision remain governed by the license
that accompanied that earlier revision; this notice does not attempt to revoke
them.
